  "workedExamples": [
    {
      "title": "欠阻尼",
      "prompt": "$x''+2x'+5x=0$，$x(0)=1$，$x'(0)=-1$。判斷類型並求 $x(t)$。",
      "problemId": "ode-h2-005",
      "steps": [
        "$2\\gamma=2\\to\\gamma=1$；$\\omega_0^2=5\\to\\omega_0=\\sqrt5\\approx2.24$。$\\gamma<\\omega_0$，欠阻尼。",
        "$\\omega_d=\\sqrt{5-1}=2$。$x=e^{-t}(C_1\\cos 2t+C_2\\sin 2t)$。",
        "$x(0)=1$：$C_1=1$。$x'(0)=-C_1+2C_2=-1$：$C_2=0$。",
        "物理上：振幅照 $e^{-t}$ 縮小，大約每 $\\pi$ 秒（$\\frac{2\\pi}{\\omega_d}$）完成一次完整振動。"
      ],
      "answer": "$x(t)=e^{-t}\\cos 2t$",
      "claim": "D2(e^(-t)*cos(2t)) == -2*D(e^(-t)*cos(2t)) - 5*e^(-t)*cos(2t) ;; SUB(e^(-t)*cos(2t), 0) == 1 ;; D(e^(-t)*cos(2t), 0) == -1"
    },
    {
      "title": "臨界阻尼",
      "prompt": "$x''+4x'+4x=0$，$x(0)=1$，$x'(0)=0$（拉開 $1$ 再靜止放手）",
      "steps": [
        "$\\gamma=2$、$\\omega_0=2$，$\\gamma=\\omega_0$，臨界阻尼。重根 $r=-2$，$x=(C_1+C_2t)e^{-2t}$。",
        "$x(0)=1$：$C_1=1$。$x'=C_2e^{-2t}-2(C_1+C_2t)e^{-2t}$，$x'(0)=C_2-2=0$，$C_2=2$。",
        "$t>0$ 時 $(1+2t)e^{-2t}>0$：木塊回到平衡但不越過。"
      ],
      "answer": "$x(t)=(1+2t)e^{-2t}$",
      "claim": "D2((1+2t)*e^(-2t)) == -4*D((1+2t)*e^(-2t)) - 4*(1+2t)*e^(-2t) ;; SUB((1+2t)*e^(-2t), 0) == 1 ;; D((1+2t)*e^(-2t), 0) == 0"
    },
    {
      "title": "過阻尼",
      "prompt": "$x''+5x'+4x=0$，$x(0)=1$，$x'(0)=0$",
      "steps": [
        "$\\gamma=2.5$、$\\omega_0=2$，$\\gamma>\\omega_0$，過阻尼。$r^2+5r+4=(r+1)(r+4)$，$r=-1$、$-4$。",
        "$x=C_1e^{-t}+C_2e^{-4t}$。$x(0)$：$C_1+C_2=1$。$x'(0)$：$-C_1-4C_2=0$。",
        "$C_1=\\frac{4}{3}$、$C_2=-\\frac{1}{3}$。$e^{-4t}$ 很快消失，之後由 $e^{-t}$ 主導，比上一題的 $e^{-2t}$ 回得慢。"
      ],
      "answer": "$x(t)=\\frac{4e^{-t}-e^{-4t}}{3}$",
      "claim": "D2((4*e^(-t)-e^(-4t))/3) == -5*D((4*e^(-t)-e^(-4t))/3) - 4*(4*e^(-t)-e^(-4t))/3 ;; SUB((4*e^(-t)-e^(-4t))/3, 0) == 1 ;; D((4*e^(-t)-e^(-4t))/3, 0) == 0"
    }
